"bm_george|Screening alert: three orders on hold":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|A print shop builds DNA that customers order, the way a poster shop prints a poster somebody sends in. I check the orders for five of those shops around this harbor.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Every order is screened before anything is made. A machine reads all of them and flags the odd ones, and then a person reads those.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
