"bm_george|Updated: there were four orders, not three. The fourth one went to Tidemark Wharf, a shop too small to be on my list, so nobody there is screening any orders at all.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|An order on hold is just a request waiting on my desk. Nothing has been made, and nothing will be made while the order stays on hold.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
